{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42114","headline":"送魏舍人仲甫爲蕲州判官 · 徐铉","name":"送魏舍人仲甫爲蕲州判官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"从事蕲春兴自长，蕲人应识紫薇郎。\n山资足後抛名路，蒓菜秋来忆故乡。\n以道卷舒犹自适，临戎谈笑固无妨。\n如闻郡阁吹横笛，时望青谿忆野王。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42114.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42114","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}